      rule: "However va nevertheless ikkalasi ham contrast (qarama-qarshilik) uchun, lekin farqlari bor:\n\nHowever � keng qo'llaniladi, rasmiy va norasmiy:\n  I wanted to go. However, I was too busy.\n\nNevertheless � rasmiyroq, to'siqqa qaramay biror ish qilish:\n  The road was blocked. Nevertheless, we arrived on time.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Asosiy farq:\n  However = oddiy contrast\n  Nevertheless = 'shunga qaramay' (to'siqqa qaramay muvaffaqiyat)\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 However o'rtada ham kela oladi, nevertheless odatda gap boshida:\n  The plan, however, was not practical.\n  Nevertheless, they tried their best.",
