      rule: "Each va Every farqlari:\n\nEACH — guruhdagi har bir a'zo alohida (individual):\n  Each student has his own desk.\n  (har bir talaba alohida stolga ega)\n  Each of the students was given a book.\n\nEVERY — guruhdagi hamma (general, collective):\n  Every student must follow the rules.\n  (umuman hamma talabalar)\n  Every day is a new beginning.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Each of + plural noun + singular verb: Each of them IS...\n\uD83D\uDD34 Every + singular noun + singular verb: Every student IS...\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC Each 2 ta uchun ham ishlatiladi: each side of the road\n\uD83D\uDCCC Every 3+ talab qiladi: every side of the triangle\n\n\uD83D\uDCCC Boshqa farqlar:\n  Every can be used with almost (almost every day)\n  Each can be used alone: Each has his own opinion.\n  Every must be followed by a noun.",
