      rule: "Either va Neither — ikkala so'z ham 2 ta narsa haqida:\n\nEITHER — ikkalasidan biri (positive):\n  You can choose either colour.\n  Either of them is suitable.\n  Either John or Mary will come.\n\nNEITHER — ikkalasi ham emas (negative):\n  Neither colour is suitable.\n  Neither of them is suitable.\n  Neither John nor Mary will come.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Either va Neither + singular noun + singular verb:\n  Either answer IS correct.\n  Neither answer IS correct.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Either of / Neither of + plural noun + singular verb:\n  Either of the answers IS correct.\n  Neither of the answers IS correct.\n\n\uD83D\uDD34 Either...or / Neither...nor:\n  Either you or I am responsible.\n  Neither the manager nor the employees were satisfied.\n  (verb eng yaqin subject ga moslashadi)",
